  "description": {
   "en": "A pessimistic man hits 30 and accepts a high-paying illegal job. He and another thug are asked to rob a bag from an old lady. But what should have been an easy gig suddenly turns into chaos when the old woman shoots his accomplice in the head. The man manages to flee with the bag, but when he opens it he can't believe his eyes. It's…!?\n\nAn ultra-conspiracy suspense story!!"
  },
